# Repository text conventions (normalized 2026-08-27).
# All text files are LF. The album .md files were CRLF; keep everything on LF to avoid
# diff noise — this rule renormalizes any stray CRLF on stage.
*.md text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
.gitignore text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf
*.editorconfig text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.tsv text eol=lf

# Audio is binary — never diff, merge, or line-ending-normalize MP3s.
*.mp3 binary

# The PDF export is a generated binary artifact (PDF internals legitimately use
# CRLF); the HTML export is regenerable text and stays on LF like everything else.
*.pdf binary
*.html text eol=lf
